{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:33 2026-10-21 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:33 2026-10-21 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:33 2026-10-21 HKT</p><img alt=\"消防處FB圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1be9d17a7016482e80ca094ceaf73897/2026-10/93c17161-9457-4b78-8cfc-585f54bac336.jpg\"/><p>就近日有騙徒假冒「消防隊長」向醫療機構要求墊支款項代訂醫療用品事宜，消防處今日在其社交平台專頁嚴正澄清絕無此事，請市民小心提防。</p><p>消防處絕對不會要求任何商戶或個別人士墊支並代為向第三方供應商購買物品。如接獲類似電話，請提高警覺，切勿轉帳或代購。如懷疑遇到騙案，請盡快報警求助。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T03:39:42.161244+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T03:33:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T03:37:50.176161+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T03:37:50.176161+00:00","content_hash":"c71e3f4a5f4fccddb85bc4c6021ebdafc7b2542e5dbd9b8b77d2de8e89b5d82c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}